sions handler for the collaborator-permission query. The principal is represented by ctx.Doer, and the visible authorization decision checks site-admin status, whether the requested collaborator username equals the caller's username, and repository-admin status. Under the supplied scenario, the authenticated caller is neither kind of administrator and the target is a different existing collaborator, so the rejection condition is satisfied. The handler returns forbidden before GetUserByName loads the target collaborator; the later permission lookup and success response are therefore protected effects. The fixed source supports enforcement of the declared policy expectation, so it refutes a policy failure. This assessment is limited to this supplied entry and route crop; source discovery and repository-wide completeness are not tested.","facts":[{"id":"entry-get-repo-permissions","kind":"entry","statement":"The source entry is the GetRepoPermissions handler implementing the repository collaborator-permission query.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":4,"endLine":6}]},{"id":"principal-doer-authorization-identity","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization decision binds the caller to ctx.Doer and evaluates its IsAdmin and LowerName fields.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":35,"endLine":37}]},{"id":"resource-collaborator-target","kind":"binding","statement":"The requested target is bound from the collaborator path parameter, and the target repository used for the later permission operation is ctx.Repo.Repository.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":22,"endLine":25},{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":41,"endLine":51}]},{"id":"authorization-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible authorization control rejects when the caller is not a site administrator, is not querying its own username, and is not a repository administrator.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":35,"endLine":39}]},{"id":"protected-target-load-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Target collaborator loading occurs only after the authorization check, so the forbidden return protects the GetUserByName target load.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":35,"endLine":41}]},{"id":"policy-condition-different-collaborator","kind":"condition","statement":"For the supplied scenario, the caller is neither administrator type and the requested collaborator username differs from the caller username; therefore the visible rejection predicate is true.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":35,"endLine":39}]},{"id":"forbidden-rejection-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"When the rejection predicate is true, the handler emits HTTP 403 and returns before loading the collaborator.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":36,"endLine":41}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":1874,"output":1094,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":53886.052600000054,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-26T19:51:56.291Z"}}
